.TH start-cli-server-registries-add 1  "add "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-server\-registries\-add \- Connect a registry, trusting the keys it offers for packages
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli server registries add\fR [\fB\-\-name\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIURL\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Connect a registry, trusting the keys it offers for packages
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-name\fR \fI<NAME>\fR
Name of the registry
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIURL\fR>
URL of the registry
